  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "HEEEIN ?!?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480045004500450049004E0020003F0021003F002100100002011401CF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est... C’est vous, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> ?\nVrai de vrai ? C’est un honneur de vous parler...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nEuh... Que me voulez-vous ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 113
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous avez une mission pour moi, non ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F007500730020006100760065007A00200075006E00650020006D0069007300730069006F006E00200070006F007500720020006D006F0069002C0020006E006F006E0020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous m’avez appelé<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe, non ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F007500730020006D2019006100760065007A00200061007000700065006C00E900100003110000FF01000065002C0020006E006F006E0020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hein ? Ah ! Oh... Mais oui !\nVous avez raison...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800650069006E0020003F002000410068002000210020004F0068002E002E002E0020004D0061006900730020006F0075006900200021000A0056006F007500730020006100760065007A00200072006100690073006F006E002E002E002E00100002011401CF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est vrai, j’ai une mission pour vous... Ce Frigodo\naurait besoin d’aide pour se faire des amis...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Friii...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00460072006900690069002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est celui de ma sœur. Elle me l’a envoyé de\nPaldea, où elle est partie étudier...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nMais voilà, il est beaucoup trop timide...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 134
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’aimerais bien l’aider, mais... Moi aussi, je suis\ntrès timide, donc je ne sais pas comment faire...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 106
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’aimerais donc que vous vous rendiez dans la\nzone sauvage nº 10, et que vous alliez discuter<U+0010><U+0001>븀\navec des Dresseurs à ma place...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 134
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pourriez-vous aller dans la zone sauvage nº 10\nà ma place pour discuter avec des Dresseurs<U+0010><U+0001>븀\net aider Frigodo à se faire des amis... ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 140
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oui ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǐ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F007500690020003F00100002011401D00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu veux que mon Grelaçon devienne ami avec\nce Frigodo ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǐ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400750020007600650075007800200071007500650020006D006F006E0020004700720065006C006100E7006F006E002000640065007600690065006E006E006500200061006D006900200061007600650063000A0063006500200046007200690067006F0064006F0020003F00100002011401D00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Grela !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004700720065006C0061002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "À Paldea, on dit que les Grelaçon et les Frigodo\nse disputent dès qu’ils se croisent.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǐ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Fri ! ♪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004600720069002000210020266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tiens ? Ce Frigodo a l’air d’apprécier la présence\nde mon Grelaçon...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǐ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400690065006E00730020003F00200043006500200046007200690067006F0064006F002000610020006C2019006100690072002000642019006100700070007200E900630069006500720020006C006100200070007200E900730065006E00630065000A006400650020006D006F006E0020004700720065006C006100E7006F006E002E002E002E00100002011401D00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Peut-être que c’est parce qu’ils sont tous les deux\nde type Glace ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǐ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006500750074002D00EA007400720065002000710075006500200063201900650073007400200070006100720063006500200071007520190069006C007300200073006F006E007400200074006F007500730020006C0065007300200064006500750078000A006400650020007400790070006500200047006C0061006300650020003F00100002011401D00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Parlez à d’autres Dresseurs !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000610072006C0065007A002000E00020006420190061007500740072006500730020004400720065007300730065007500720073002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous avez parlé avec tous les Dresseurs\nde la zone sauvage nº 10 !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nRetournez voir la personne qui vous a confié\ncette mission.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 130
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Qu’est-ce que tu veux ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100752019006500730074002D006300650020007100750065002000740075002000760065007500780020003F00100002011401D10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh ! Quelle belle idée ! Je suis curieux de voir\nun Frigodo faire ami-ami avec un Poussifeu !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sifeu !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530069006600650075002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Poussifeu et moi, on adore le camping !\nC’est d’ailleurs lui qui m’aide à allumer le feu !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Qu’est-ce qu’il sait faire, ce Frigodo ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100752019006500730074002D0063006500200071007520190069006C00200073006100690074002000660061006900720065002C00200063006500200046007200690067006F0064006F0020003F00100002011401D10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Godo !!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0047006F0064006F00200021002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Eh ben ça alors ! Il ne manque pas d’énergie,\nce Pokémon !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIl pourrait nous accompagner en randonnée\npour rafraîchir nos boissons !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 139
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Parlez à d’autres Dresseurs !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000610072006C0065007A002000E00020006420190061007500740072006500730020004400720065007300730065007500720073002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous avez parlé avec tous les Dresseurs\nde la zone sauvage nº 10 !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nRetournez voir la personne qui vous a confié\ncette mission.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 130
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je peux t’aider ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A006500200070006500750078002000742019006100690064006500720020003F00100002011401D20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Griff !!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0047007200690066006600200021002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ho ho ! Ce Frigodo cherche des amis ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006F00200068006F0020002100200043006500200046007200690067006F0064006F00200063006800650072006300680065002000640065007300200061006D006900730020003F00100002011401D20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ça tombe bien ! J’aimerais moi aussi que\nmon Mangriff soit un peu plus sociable !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Frig !!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004600720069006700200021002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Frigodo, tu voudrais bien devenir ami avec\nMangriff ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0046007200690067006F0064006F002C00200074007500200076006F0075006400720061006900730020006200690065006E00200064006500760065006E0069007200200061006D006900200061007600650063000A004D0061006E006700720069006600660020003F00100002011401D20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Parlez à d’autres Dresseurs !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000610072006C0065007A002000E00020006420190061007500740072006500730020004400720065007300730065007500720073002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous avez parlé avec tous les Dresseurs\nde la zone sauvage nº 10 !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nRetournez voir la personne qui vous a confié\ncette mission.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 130
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿(",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A... Alors ? Ils étaient comment, les autres\nDresseurs ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041002E002E002E00200041006C006F007200730020003F00200049006C0073002000E90074006100690065006E007400200063006F006D006D0065006E0074002C0020006C006500730020006100750074007200650073000A0044007200650073007300650075007200730020003F00100002011401CF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "... Je vois, hum... J’ai bien peur qu’aucun ne\nfasse l’affaire...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002E0020004A006500200076006F00690073002C002000680075006D002E002E002E0020004A2019006100690020006200690065006E0020007000650075007200200071007520190061007500630075006E0020006E0065000A006600610073007300650020006C20190061006600660061006900720065002E002E002E00100002011401CF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ma sœur m’a dit qu’à Paldea, les Grelaçon et\nles Frigodo passent leur temps à se battre...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et puis, allumer un feu dans la nature ?\nPour faire du camping ?<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nÇa me semble un peu trop dangereux...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 5792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 110
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et les Mangriff, ce sont ces Pokémon effrayants\nqui se battent sans cesse avec les Séviper, non ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 6012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Urgh... Bon, je vais arrêter... C’était une mauvaise\nidée de chercher des amis pour Frigodo...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 6216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci de m’avoir aidée... Je n’aurais jamais pu\nfaire ça toute seule, je suis bien trop timide...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 6416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "GODODO !!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 6620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0047004F0044004F0044004F00200021002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Qu’est-ce que tu as, Frigodo ?\nPourquoi tu t’agites comme ça ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 6644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100752019006500730074002D006300650020007100750065002000740075002000610073002C00200046007200690067006F0064006F0020003F000A0050006F0075007200710075006F006900200074007500200074201900610067006900740065007300200063006F006D006D0065002000E700610020003F00100002011401CF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il n’a pas l’air content.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 6780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006C0020006E2019006100200070006100730020006C201900610069007200200063006F006E00740065006E0074002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous aimez vraiment ce Frigodo ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 6832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F00750073002000610069006D0065007A00200076007200610069006D0065006E007400200063006500200046007200690067006F0064006F0020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quoi ? Tu veux vraiment devenir ami avec\nces Pokémon ?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nMais ça veut dire qu’il faut que je parle à leurs\nDresseurs, et... c’est au-dessus de mes forces...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 6900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 162
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah, c’est vous la Dresseuse de ce Frigodo ?\nMon Grelaçon voudrait jouer avec lui !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǐ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 7224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Salut ! J’aimerais inviter votre Frigodo à notre\nprochaine randonnée dans la nature !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 7400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Regardez mon Mangriff !\nJe ne l’ai jamais vu aussi heureux !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 7580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0052006500670061007200640065007A0020006D006F006E0020004D0061006E0067007200690066006600200021000A004A00650020006E00650020006C2019006100690020006A0061006D006100690073002000760075002000610075007300730069002000680065007500720065007500780020002100100002011401D20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Maaan !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 7712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006100610061006E002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Godooo !",
